---
import { BRAND } from '../lib/brand';
import HelloFraandsPage from '../layouts/HelloFraandsPage.astro';
---
<HelloFraandsPage title="Emergency & mental-health support" summary="Sankat mein trained madad se abhi sampark karein." review={true} related={[{"href":"/disclaimer","label":"Service disclaimer"},{"href":"/privacy","label":"Privacy policy"},{"href":"/grievance","label":"Grievance redressal"}]}>
<p><strong>{BRAND.name} is not a crisis service. Hosts are not counsellors.</strong> If you or someone else is in immediate danger, call emergency services now. Do not wait for a platform reply.</p>
<h2>Call for help now</h2>
<div class="help-numbers">
<a href="tel:112"><strong>Emergency</strong><span>Call 112</span></a>
<a href="tel:14416"><strong>Tele-MANAS</strong><span>Call 14416</span></a>
<a href="tel:9152987821"><strong>iCall</strong><span>Call 9152987821</span></a>
<a href="tel:18602662345"><strong>Vandrevala</strong><span>Call 1860-2662-345</span></a>
</div>
<p>Helpline availability can vary. If you cannot connect and there is immediate danger, call <a href="tel:112">112</a> or go to the nearest emergency department. If you can, ask a trusted person to stay with you while you seek help.</p>
<p>Read how we keep conversations healthy: <a href="/wellbeing">use it in a healthy way</a>.</p>
<p>For a concern about a platform call, <a href="/report">send a report</a> after urgent help is arranged.</p>
<style>
.help-numbers{display:grid;gap:1rem;margin:2rem 0}.help-numbers a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;padding:1.3rem;border:2px solid currentColor;border-radius:16px;font-size:1.2rem;text-decoration:none;min-height:64px;align-items:center}
</style>
</HelloFraandsPage>
